Context: This page is the first page of a resume for Rihobot Elias Bogale, a Full-Stack & AI Software Engineer. It includes his contact information, a summary of his experience, and his professional experience with detailed job descriptions.
Text: RIHOBOT ELIAS BOGALE
FULL-STACK & AI SOFTWARE ENGINEER
